# Secret better-auth uses to sign session cookies. Generate a real one with
# `openssl rand -base64 32` (or `node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('base64'))"`)
# and set it as an Environment Variable in the Vercel project — never commit
# the real value here. Needed locally too (put it in .env.local) once an
# admin user has been seeded, since a changed secret invalidates sessions.
BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=
